@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "平台前端" as Frontend
participant "voimed" as Voimed

Voimed -> Voimed : 内部处理\n(VAD 自动开始段)
Voimed --> Frontend : SegmentStarted { source: continuous }
Voimed --> Frontend : State { recording: true }

loop Recording
  Voimed -> Voimed : 内部处理\n(Preview / 分段)
  Voimed --> Frontend : Partial
end

Voimed -> Voimed : 内部处理\n(VAD 终点 / Final 调度)
Voimed --> Frontend : State { finalizing: true }
Voimed --> Frontend : Final
Voimed --> Frontend : State { idle }

note over Frontend, Voimed
  Continuous 不使用热键；每个语音段独立开始与结束。
end note
@enduml
